  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 618 days before the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA posted the ketamine hydrochloride shortage on 2018-02-16 and it has remained on the list for 104 months as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A registered plant on our labels, Hospira, Inc. (FEI 1925262), received an OAI classification after an inspection that ended 2016-06-08, which was 618 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D5", "E14", "E20"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The same plant later received a Warning Letter on 2017-02-14 (367 days before posting) and another OAI inspection ending 2018-08-15 (180 days after posting).",
      "cites": ["D6", "D8", "E19", "E16"]
    ],
    {
      "text": "Our Corvale General stock includes product labeled by Henry Schein, Inc. and manufactured at Fresenius Kabi Lake Zurich, which is not the OAI-classified Hospira plant.",
      "cites": ["E4", "E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 21 days on hand and can spare 15 units while keeping two weeks of supply.",
      "cites": ["D2", "D11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 7 days on hand and would reach 14 days after receiving the transfer.",
      "cites": ["D3", "D11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-selected action is to transfer 15 units from Corvale General to Corvale Lakeside, which requires a pharmacy director transfer request.",
      "cites": ["D11"]
    }
  ]
}
